---
import Diagram from './Diagram.astro';
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/frame-request-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/frame-request-dark.svg?raw';
---

<Diagram
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  maxWidth={640}
  caption="The route: a signed link, one front door, and a container that only ever reads."
>
  A signed link carrying a timestamp and width arrives at the edge worker,
  which verifies the signature and checks its cache. A moment it has seen
  before returns a JPEG instantly. A first look goes to the frame service,
  a container running pinned ffmpeg with a read-only credential, which
  range-reads a few megabytes from private object storage and returns the
  JPEG in about two seconds.
</Diagram>
